#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:5
#: bb02763190e74b0c921b797a4cbf5940
msgid "Testing the Balance Bot"
msgstr "测试平衡机器人"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:7
#: 8cea468438ae463fa9e799fe6aefb3d9
msgid ""
"If you have completed all the previous steps successfully, then you're all "
"set to start testing!"
msgstr "如果您已成功完成所有先前步骤，那么就可以开始测试了！"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:12
#: 05507d7ad17f4db0b20bacf41eec5b33
msgid ""
"For testing, make sure your vehicle is connected to the GCS via telemetry "
"radio. USB would be too messy! Though we would suggest using mavproxy, "
"Mission Planner works fine too."
msgstr ""
"测试时，请确保您的车辆通过遥测无线电连接到地面站。使用 USB 会比较麻烦！虽然我们建议使用 mavproxy，但 Mission Planner "
"也同样适用。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:14
#: 07c3ddbbdd224cf38c840b6e8197ed11
msgid "Turn your vehicle on and connect to GCS."
msgstr "开启车辆并连接到地面站。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:16
#: 696ee3aadd1043399776be5793c01c37
msgid ""
"Make sure your vehicle is standing nearly upright, then arm it from the GCS "
"(It's better this way than from radio)."
msgstr "确保车辆几乎直立，然后从地面站解锁（这比从遥控器解锁更好）。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:18
#: c0d10810dd82425d88414f32d421a17c
msgid ""
"If all is good, your vehicle should be able to balance itself or at least be"
" trying to."
msgstr "如果一切正常，您的车辆应该能够自主平衡，或者至少在努力尝试平衡。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:20
#: 0e81d8a1bd974d7e8b687eda8cfdb4c7
msgid ""
"If the vehicle is trying to balance, but it's not perfect, try adjusting the"
" PID values live(via GCS). If that isn't helping, turn the vehicle off. Go "
"to the hardware page and see if you've met all the guidelines, especially "
"regarding the wheels and weight distribution."
msgstr ""
"如果车辆在尝试平衡但效果不理想，请尝试通过地面站实时调整 PID "
"值。如果仍无帮助，请关闭车辆，查阅硬件页面，检查是否满足所有指南要求，尤其是关于车轮和重量分布的要求。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:22
#: fe4ff1bccbc14318a50e9fe462cbbad1
msgid ""
"Once the vehicle can balance itself, try moving it around. Move up the "
"throttle slightly and see how it goes."
msgstr "一旦车辆能够自主平衡，尝试驾驶它移动。稍微增大油门，观察效果如何。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:24
#: 40cba2767a7340f8a58106e4a700fc58
msgid ""
"If you find it too difficult to drive, try adjusting "
":ref:`BAL_PITCH_MAX<BAL_PITCH_MAX>`. It's the pitch angle at 100% throttle. "
"If you increase it, the vehicle will accelerate faster but will become more "
"likely to topple. Reducing it will make it more stable, but sluggish."
msgstr ""
"如果发现驾驶过于困难，请尝试调整 :ref:`BAL_PITCH_MAX<BAL_PITCH_MAX>`。该参数为 100% "
"油门时的俯仰角。增大该值会使车辆加速更快，但更容易倾倒；减小该值会使车辆更稳定，但响应变慢。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:28
#: 6832149f841f4a519050410ea3d6a50e
msgid ""
"It is possible to obtain better behavior of the rover by adjusting its PID. "
"The :ref:`tuning page <balance_bot-tuning>` has more detailed information."
msgstr "通过调整 PID 可以改善 Rover 的行为表现。:ref:`调参页面 <balance_bot-tuning>` 中有更详细的信息。"
